<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

The standoff machine enters a standoff once per key, steps aside on a reading, resolves on an act, and carries the person's door (`takeRecords`) and the render a merge reads (`standoffRender`). The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

